   "stem": "在埃拉托斯特尼筛法中，要筛选出不大于 n 的所有素数，最外层循环应该遍历什么范围（   ）？vector<int> sieveOfEratosthenes(int n) {\r\n\tstd::vector<bool> isPrime(n + 1, true);\r\n\tstd::vector<int> primes;\r\n\t_______________________ {\r\n\t\tif (isPrime[i]) {\r\n\t\t\tprimes.push_back(i);\r\n\t\t\tfor (int j = i * i; j <= n; j += i) {\r\n\t\t\t\tisPrime[j] = false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\tfor (int i = sqrt(n) + 1; i <= n; ++i) {\r\n\t\tif (isPrime[i]) {\r\n\t\t\tprimes.push_back(i);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\treturn primes;\r\n}",
